---
// About page
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="About" 
  description="Technical Architect with expertise in healthcare interoperability, HL7 FHIR, and API architecture"
>
  <div class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>About Me</h1>
      
      <div class="content-wrapper">
        <p class="lead">
          I'm a Technical Architect specializing in healthcare interoperability, 
          with deep expertise in HL7 FHIR, CDA, and cross-border healthcare data exchange.
        </p>
        
        <h2>Background</h2>
        <p>
          I work at the intersection of healthcare, standards, and practical software delivery. 
          I'm a full-stack web developer working as a Technical Architect, based in Clane, Ireland.
          I enjoy coding and problem-solving, but most of all, I enjoy being part of a much bigger team.
        </p>
        
        <p>
          My focus is on making complex interoperability problems understandable and building 
          systems that work reliably in production. I work with the Health Service Executive (HSE) 
          in Ireland, leading technical architecture for healthcare interoperability initiatives 
          including Ireland's implementation of MyHealth@EU for cross-border patient data exchange.
        </p>
        
        <h2>Expertise</h2>
        
        <h3>Healthcare Standards & Interoperability</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>HL7 FHIR</strong> - Implementation, profiling, and governance across healthcare systems</li>
          <li><strong>HL7 CDA</strong> - Clinical document architecture and transformation workflows</li>
          <li><strong>MyHealth@EU</strong> - Cross-border healthcare data exchange and Patient Summary</li>
          <li><strong>IHE Profiles</strong> - XDS, XCA, and other integration patterns</li>
          <li><strong>Medical Imaging</strong> - DICOM, IHE XDS-I, and imaging interoperability</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h3>Technical Architecture</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>API Design</strong> - RESTful APIs, governance, documentation, and developer experience</li>
          <li><strong>Integration Platforms</strong> - Design and delivery of healthcare integration infrastructure</li>
          <li><strong>Security Architecture</strong> - Healthcare data protection and privacy-preserving design</li>
          <li><strong>Cloud Architecture</strong> - Azure-based healthcare solutions and modern deployment patterns</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h3>Software Development</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Python</strong> - Django, Django REST Framework, Flask</li>
          <li><strong>Frontend</strong> - Angular, TypeScript, HTML, JavaScript</li>
          <li><strong>Java</strong> - Healthcare integration servers and tools</li>
          <li><strong>Data</strong> - PostgreSQL, MongoDB, data modeling for healthcare</li>
          <li><strong>DevOps</strong> - Docker, CI/CD, containerization</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h2>Approach</h2>
        <p>
          I believe in:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Standards-based solutions</strong> that enable interoperability</li>
          <li><strong>Clear documentation</strong> that makes complex topics accessible</li>
          <li><strong>Practical delivery</strong> over theoretical perfection</li>
          <li><strong>Developer experience</strong> as a key success factor</li>
          <li><strong>Security and privacy</strong> by design</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h2>Current Focus</h2>
        <p>
          My current work involves:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Leading Ireland's MyHealth@EU Patient Summary implementation</li>
          <li>Establishing FHIR as the primary integration standard for HSE systems</li>
          <li>Designing API platforms and developer tools for healthcare integration</li>
          <li>Contributing to European healthcare interoperability initiatives</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h2>Connect</h2>
        <p>
          I'm interested in healthcare interoperability challenges, standards implementation, 
          and how technology can improve healthcare delivery.
        </p>
        
        <div class="btn-group" style="margin-top: var(--space-xl);">
          <a href="/projects" class="btn btn-primary">View Projects</a>
          <a href="/timeline" class="btn btn-outline">See Timeline</a>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-secondary">Get in Touch</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
